.TH MARBOR\-CLOUD 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-cloud \- manage cloud overflow providers and view budget status
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor cloud
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
manage cloud overflow providers and view budget status
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B providers
list/add/update/delete/reorder/test cloud providers
.TP
.B providers list
list cloud providers (does not display the API key)
.TP
.B providers add
add a cloud provider
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-name string
provider config name (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-provider string
provider type, e.g. openai, anthropic, openrouter (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-base-url string
provider API base URL (required if \-\-enabled)
.TP
.B \-\-api-key string
provider API key (required if \-\-enabled) - never echoed back by "list"
.TP
.B \-\-default-model string
default model for this provider
.TP
.B \-\-cost-per-1k string
cost per 1K tokens in USD, for savings tracking
.TP
.B \-\-priority int
fallback priority (lower tries first)
.TP
.B \-\-enabled
enable immediately
.RE
.TP
.B providers update <name>
update a cloud provider (omit \-\-api-key to keep the stored key)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-provider string
provider type, e.g. openai, anthropic, openrouter
.TP
.B \-\-base-url string
provider API base URL
.TP
.B \-\-api-key string
provider API key (omit to keep the currently stored key)
.TP
.B \-\-default-model string
default model for this provider
.TP
.B \-\-cost-per-1k string
cost per 1K tokens in USD, for savings tracking
.TP
.B \-\-priority int
fallback priority (lower tries first)
.TP
.B \-\-enabled
enable this provider
.RE
.TP
.B providers delete <name>
delete a cloud provider
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-yes
confirm deletion without prompting
.RE
.TP
.B providers reorder <names>
set cloud provider fallback priority order
.TP
.B providers test
verify a base\-url+api\-key pair authenticates, without saving it
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-provider string
provider type (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-base-url string
provider API base URL (required) (required)
.TP
.B \-\-api-key string
provider API key to test (required) (required)
.RE
.TP
.B budget\-status
show global and per\-key cloud spend vs budget caps
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
